---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Events & Parties | Burgas 2027 Eurovision" 
  description="Discover the EuroVillage interactive map, official afterparties, and the complete guide to the Arena Burgas bag policy and capacity."
  breadcrumb="Events & Parties"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <h1 class="text-gradient">Event & Parties Guide</h1>
    <p class="lead">The official schedule, secret club nights, and everything you need to know about getting into the Arena.</p>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="main-column">
        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>🎶 EuroVillage Interactive Guide</h2>
          <p>The EuroVillage will be located in the Sea Garden (Морска градина), stretching along the coast. Expect daily live performances, food trucks, and sponsor activations.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="bag-policy">
          <h2>🎒 Arena Burgas Eurovision Capacity & Bag Policy</h2>
          <p>If you scored a ticket, read this carefully to avoid being turned away at the gates.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Capacity:</strong> Arena Burgas will host approximately 10,000 fans per show (Family Show, Jury Show, and Live Broadcasts).</li>
            <li><strong>Bag Policy:</strong> Strictly enforced. Only clear bags or small clutches (max A5 size) are permitted. Backpacks will NOT be allowed inside the security perimeter.</li>
            <li><strong>Flags:</strong> Only flags of participating countries and the Pride flag are allowed. No sticks.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>📱 Stay Connected (No Roaming Fees)</h2>
          <p>You will need internet for your digital tickets, ordering Ubers/taxis, and posting videos from the EuroClub. Roaming fees in Bulgaria can be astronomical if you are outside the EU.</p>
          <div class="insider-note">
            <strong>Insider Note:</strong> Don't buy physical SIM cards at the airport (they overcharge tourists). Buy a digital eSIM before you fly.
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px; display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Buy Bulgaria eSIM (Airalo)" href="https://www.airalo.com/bulgaria-esim" provider="generic" />
            <AffiliateButton text="eSIM Alternative (Yesim)" href="https://yesim.tech/" provider="yesim" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>🪩 Afterparties & Nightlife</h2>
          <p>Burgas has a vibrant club scene. During the Eurovision week, the main hotspots will be the beach bars along the central promenade.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px; padding: 24px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-magenta); margin-bottom: 8px;">👑 VIP Table Booking & Secret Parties</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">We have direct contacts with the top club managers in Burgas. Leave your email, and we will send you the secret links for private yacht parties and VIP table reservations before they sell out.</p>
            <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
              <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="03b548cb-5509-4e30-91a0-785800f9f395">
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name or Delegation" required style="width:100%; padding:10px; border-radius:4px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color:#fff;" />
              <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required style="width:100%; padding:10px; border-radius:4px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color:#fff;" />
              <select name="request_type" style="width:100%; padding:10px; border-radius:4px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border); background:#111; color:#fff;">
                <option value="yacht">Private Yacht Party Access</option>
                <option value="vip">EuroClub VIP Table</option>
                <option value="both">Both</option>
              </select>
              <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://burgas2027guide.com/events-and-parties">
              <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="VIP Concierge Request!">
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:10px; font-weight:bold;">Request Access</button>
            </form>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="glass-panel sticky-box">
          <h3>Essential Services</h3>
          <p>Don't land without these:</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <a href="/essential-apps" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width:100%; text-align:center;">📱 eSIM & Connectivity Guide</a>
          </div>

          <hr style="margin: 24px 0; border-color: var(--glass-border);" />

          <h3>🛡️ Travel Insurance</h3>
          <p>Cover cancellations, medical emergencies, and lost luggage before you fly.</p>
          <AffiliateButton text="Get Travel Insurance (EKTA)" href="https://ektatraveling.com/" provider="ekta" />

          <hr style="margin: 24px 0; border-color: var(--glass-border);" />

          <h3>Secure Your Tickets</h3>
          <p>Check official resale partners and secure your entrance to the biggest side-events.</p>
          <AffiliateButton text="Browse Events (Viator)" href="https://www.viator.com/" provider="generic" />
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .mb-4 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .insider-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-amber);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .sticky-box {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .sticky-box h3 {
    color: var(--accent-magenta);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
